{"seq":3,"slug":"weak-programmatic-labeling","title":"弱监督与编程式标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/weak-programmatic-labeling","wordCount":1674,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"弱监督与编程式标注\">弱监督与编程式标注</h1><p>主动学习省的是「标哪些」，但每条仍要人逐条标。弱监督走得更远：它问，能不能根本不标个例？一个领域专家心里其实装着一堆规则——「邮件里出现『中奖』『点击链接』多半是垃圾邮件」「化验单里 ALT 超过 40 大概率异常」。与其让他把这些规则在脑子里对十万条数据逐条应用，不如让他把规则写成代码，让机器把规则应用到全量数据。这就是编程式标注（programmatic labeling）的核心，以 Snorkel 的数据编程范式为代表。这一篇讲它怎么用一组噪声、冲突的「标注函数」生成大规模概率标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>弱监督的转变是：标注的单位从「样本」变成「标注函数（labeling function, LF）」。Snorkel 的范式是——你写多个 LF（Python 启发式、正则、知识库查询、甚至 LLM 调用），每个都不完美（有的覆盖率低、有的会出错、彼此还可能冲突），然后一个 label model 学习每个 LF 的可靠度并把它们融合成每条样本的概率标签，最后用这些概率标签训练最终模型。Snorkel 在 2026 年的更新方向，正是用生成式 AI 驱动标注函数，在减少人工的同时保持透明和可审计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[专家领域知识] --&gt; B[写多个标注函数 LF&lt;br/&gt;规则 / 正则 / 知识库 / LLM]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每个 LF 给样本投票&lt;br/&gt;含弃权 / 噪声 / 冲突]&#10;  C --&gt; D[label model&lt;br/&gt;估每个 LF 可靠度并去噪]&#10;  D --&gt; E[概率标签&lt;br/&gt;每条样本一个软标签]&#10;  E --&gt; F[训练最终判别模型&lt;br/&gt;能泛化到 LF 未覆盖处]\">flowchart TD\n  A[专家领域知识] --&gt; B[写多个标注函数 LF&lt;br/&gt;规则 / 正则 / 知识库 / LLM]\n  B --&gt; C[每个 LF 给样本投票&lt;br/&gt;含弃权 / 噪声 / 冲突]\n  C --&gt; D[label model&lt;br/&gt;估每个 LF 可靠度并去噪]\n  D --&gt; E[概率标签&lt;br/&gt;每条样本一个软标签]\n  E --&gt; F[训练最终判别模型&lt;br/&gt;能泛化到 LF 未覆盖处]</pre><p>下表对比弱监督与传统人工标注、主动学习在标注单位与成本结构上的根本差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>标注单位</th>\n<th>人工成本</th>\n<th>标签质量</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统人工标注</td>\n<td>单个样本</td>\n<td>线性于样本数</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>受人力限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动学习</td>\n<td>挑出的关键样本</td>\n<td>亚线性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱监督</td>\n<td>标注函数（一次性）</td>\n<td>几乎与规模无关</td>\n<td>中（含噪声）</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标注函数-把知识写成代码\">标注函数：把知识写成代码</h2><p>一个标注函数接收一条样本，返回一个标签或「弃权」（abstain，表示这条它管不了）。关键是 LF 被允许不完美——覆盖率低、有错、彼此冲突都没关系，因为后面的 label model 会处理。下面是垃圾邮件分类的几个 LF 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"ABSTAIN, HAM, SPAM = -1, 0, 1&#10;&#10;def lf_keyword_winner(x):           # 关键词规则&#10;    return SPAM if &quot;中奖&quot; in x.text else ABSTAIN&#10;&#10;def lf_many_links(x):               # 启发式&#10;    return SPAM if x.text.count(&quot;http&quot;) &gt; 3 else ABSTAIN&#10;&#10;def lf_known_sender(x):             # 知识库查询&#10;    return HAM if x.sender in trusted_contacts else ABSTAIN&#10;&#10;def lf_llm_judge(x):                # LLM 作为一个 LF&#10;    return ask_llm(f&quot;这是垃圾邮件吗? {x.text}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ABSTAIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">HAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SPAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lf_keyword_winner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x):           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键词规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SPAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"中奖\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABSTAIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lf_many_links</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x):               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启发式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SPAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.text.count(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABSTAIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lf_known_sender</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x):             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 知识库查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> HAM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.sender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trusted_contacts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABSTAIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lf_llm_judge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x):                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LLM 作为一个 LF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ask_llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"这是垃圾邮件吗? </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x.text</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意每个 LF 大量返回 ABSTAIN——它只在自己有把握的子集上发声。一个 LF 的两个关键指标是覆盖率（它对多少比例样本发声）和准确率（发声时对的比例）。低覆盖高准确、或高覆盖中准确都有价值，多个 LF 互补才能覆盖全体。把 LLM 当成一个 LF 是 2026 年的常见做法，它把弱监督和 <a href=\"../practice/llm-assisted-labeling\">LLM 辅助标注</a> 直接连起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"label-model-从噪声投票里去噪\">label model：从噪声投票里去噪</h2><p>如果只是把所有 LF 多数投票，差 LF 会拖累好 LF。Snorkel 的 label model 更聪明：它在没有真标签的情况下，仅凭 LF 之间投票的一致与冲突模式，反推出每个 LF 的隐含准确率，再据此加权融合。直觉是——一个总是和其他可靠 LF 一致的 LF 大概也可靠；一个老是和大家唱反调的 LF 大概不可靠。</p>\n<p>形式上，设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个 LF，label model 假设每个 LF 的输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由真标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 经一个含噪声的过程生成，用类似 <a href=\"quality-agreement\">质量与标注一致性</a> 里 Dawid-Skene 的思路，最大化观测投票的似然来估计参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（各 LF 的准确率）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>y</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta} = \\arg\\max_{\\theta} \\; \\prod_{j} \\; \\sum_{y} \\; P_\\theta(\\lambda_1^{(j)}, \\dots, \\lambda_m^{(j)}, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>求解后，每条样本得到一个概率标签 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y|\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非硬标签——这保留了不确定性信息。这正是「从多个不完美来源推断真值」，和上一篇人工标注的裁决问题是同一个数学骨架，只不过来源从人换成了代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么还要训一个判别模型\">为什么还要训一个判别模型</h2><p>一个自然的疑问：有了概率标签，为什么不直接用 label model 当分类器？因为 label model 只能标 LF 覆盖到的样本——LF 都弃权的样本它无能为力。最后一步是用概率标签去训练一个普通的判别模型（如神经网络），它能<strong>泛化到 LF 从未覆盖的样本</strong>：模型从「有 http 链接的被标 SPAM」这些信号里，学到更一般的垃圾邮件特征，从而对没有任何 LF 命中的新邮件也能判断。这一步叫「noise-aware 训练」，损失函数对软标签加权，相当于让模型相信高置信概率标签、对低置信的留余地。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>能力边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LF 投票</td>\n<td>原始样本</td>\n<td>每 LF 一票（含弃权）</td>\n<td>仅 LF 命中处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>label model</td>\n<td>投票矩阵</td>\n<td>概率标签</td>\n<td>仅至少一 LF 命中处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判别模型</td>\n<td>概率标签 + 特征</td>\n<td>泛化预测</td>\n<td>全体，含 LF 盲区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"弱监督的边界与组合\">弱监督的边界与组合</h2><p>弱监督不是万能的。它适合「专家有清晰可编码规则、且容忍一定标签噪声」的场景（大规模文本分类、信息抽取），不适合「规则难以言传」的任务（细粒度图像审美、需要逐像素精度的分割）。它的标签质量上限由 LF 的整体质量决定——如果没有任何 LF 能覆盖某类样本，那类就是盲区。</p>\n<p>实践中弱监督常和本 hub 其它方法组合，而非替代。一种强力组合是：用弱监督快速生成海量含噪声标签做预训练或冷启动，再用 <a href=\"../foundations/active-learning-loop\">主动学习循环</a> 精标 label model 最不确定的那批样本来打磨——弱监督管广度、主动学习管精度。另一种是把 LF 生成的概率标签当作模型预标注的来源，喂进 <a href=\"annotation-workflows\">标注工作流与工具</a> 让人校验。弱监督生成的含噪声标签，本质上也是一种需要被评估和清洗的数据质量问题，处理视角与 <a href=\"../../data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/data-quality-dimensions\">数据质量维度</a> 相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>弱监督把标注单位从「样本」换成「标注函数」——写规则代码，让机器标全量数据。</li>\n<li>标注函数被允许不完美（低覆盖、有错、冲突），靠 label model 融合去噪。</li>\n<li>label model 在无真标签下仅凭 LF 投票的一致/冲突模式反推各 LF 可靠度，输出概率标签。</li>\n<li>最后必须再训一个判别模型，才能泛化到所有 LF 都弃权的盲区样本。</li>\n<li>弱监督管广度、容噪声，常与主动学习（管精度）、人工校验组合而非替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../practice/llm-assisted-labeling\">LLM 辅助标注</a>——把 LLM 当作一个标注函数；<a href=\"quality-agreement\">质量与标注一致性</a>——label model 与人工裁决共享的去噪数学。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../data-cleaning-preprocessing/quality-and-significance/data-quality-dimensions\">数据质量维度</a>——含噪声弱标签作为数据质量问题的处理视角。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"弱监督与编程式标注","id":"弱监督与编程式标注"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标注函数：把知识写成代码","id":"标注函数-把知识写成代码"},{"level":2,"text":"label model：从噪声投票里去噪","id":"label-model-从噪声投票里去噪"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么还要训一个判别模型","id":"为什么还要训一个判别模型"},{"level":2,"text":"弱监督的边界与组合","id":"弱监督的边界与组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"质量与标注一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/quality-agreement"},"next":{"title":"人在回路 ML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/practice/human-in-the-loop-ml"}}